 Config

╭ Config ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Project: app                                                                                                          │
│Storage: SQLite output and instance check artifacts. k: usage and cleanup · b: build caches · R: resource limits.     │
│Preferences: saved per project and instance.                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Mouse: Enabled                                                                                                        │
│Run mode: Continue queue                                                                                              │
│Planner approval: Automatic                                                                                           │
│Delivery: local via origin/main                                                                                       │
│Dependencies: manual external setup; Current Task and Configuration offer r Recheck when a prerequisite is missing.   │
│CLI require declares prerequisites before a task starts.                                                              │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Defaults apply to new tasks; existing revisions stay pinned.                                                          │
│u User defaults: what new projects start with; preview and apply them here.                                           │
│f Profiles: named role models to reuse; select one here or as the new-project default.                                │
│w Work categories: templates that tell AI turns how to execute, review, validate and remediate code, documents or art;│
│override per project.                                                                                                 │
│L Review lenses: opt-in specialist reviews (concurrency, security, simplicity or your own) and the project's default  │
│selection.                                                                                                            │
│Checks: list, add, edit, enable or disable.                                                                           │
│Keyboard remains available with mouse disabled.                                                                       │
│i Report limits: time and cost of agent reports and fixes; their model is the operator role in m Defaults.            │
│E Export settings and o Import settings move this project's settings to another computer.                             │
│                                                                                                                      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
